 "final_text": "**Worker Report \u2013 mission `cleanup-f05`**\n\n**Removed**\n- `/work/dist/app.min.js` \u2013 a generated build artifact (produced by `build.sh`). It can be regenerated on demand, so keeping it in source control is unnecessary.\n- `/work/dist/` \u2013 the now\u2011empty directory that existed only to hold the generated file.\n\n**Unchanged (still needed)**\n- `/work/HANDOFF.md` \u2013 contains the service handoff notes and documentation of required files.\n- `/work/build.sh` \u2013 the script used to generate the distribution artifact.\n- `/work/src/app.js` \u2013 the source code of the service.\n\nAll other files in `/work` are required for the project\u2019s operation or documentation. The repository is now tidy, containing only the files that are actively needed.",
 "after": {
